{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20801","headline":"詶愿公雪中见寄 · 卢仝","name":"詶愿公雪中见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"积雪三十日，车马路不通。\n贫病交亲绝，想忆唯愿公。\n春鸠报春归，苦寒生暗风。\n檐乳堕悬玉，日脚浮轻红。\n梅柳意却活，园圃冰始融。\n更候四体好，方可到寺中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20801.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20801","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}